/T (In the field of data science and machine learning, classification mod- els are crucial for predicting categorical outcomes based on input features. This report focuses on the development and evaluation of various classification models to predict criminal behavior from a dataset of potential suspects. The dataset comprises various features, including demographic and occupational information, with the target variable indicating whether an individual is a criminal or not.)
/E (In the field of data science and machine learning, classification mod- els are crucial for predicting categorical outcomes based on input features. This report focuses on the development and evaluation of various classification models to predict criminal behavior from a dataset of potential suspects. The dataset comprises various features, including demographic and occupational information, with the target variable indicating whether an individual is a criminal or not.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [40]
>>
